<h1 id="a000038">Living Cheap in NYC</h1>

<p><a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/theroadislife/53212218/" title="Photo Sharing"><img src="http://static.flickr.com/25/53212218_f051b5981f.jpg" width="480" height="360" alt="Living Cheap in NYC" /></a></p>



